  "notes": {
    "apiImage": "The 1 October API image (ot-t5-api, sha256:e819f089…) predates rate limiting/OPENTRANSIT_TRUSTED_PROXIES (PR #4) and the integrity-attestation startup path (PR #13), so it is not pushed; the API image is rebuilt from this branch's commit once the generation session's Docker work is done.",
    "taskRole": "No task role is created: the drafts and the hosting plan keep the serving task role absent (no AWS credentials in the task at all), and validate_drafts rejects taskRoleArn. Only the execution role exists.",
    "dockerAuth": "Windows Credential Manager rejected the ECR token ('The stub received bad data'); h0_bounded_test.py writes the ECR auth to a throwaway DOCKER_CONFIG under the temp directory and deletes it after the push."
